{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/LogoDemoRR.png?t=1753713523\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Rust Rides: Adventure on Wheels</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Survival. Racing. Cars with soul.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get behind the wheel of a time-worn car and set off on an open journey through rural expanses, where every kilometer can change your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Rust Rides, you don't just drive \u2014 you learn to survive, trade, collect equipment, build your base, and compete in races with other travelers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">______________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Game world:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the start, you only have an old car, a little fuel, and a map with suggested routes. The rest is up to luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your first spare parts, negotiate with a dealer, trade metal for a wheel, upgrade your engine, and move on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game has no fixed storyline \u2014 the world reacts to your actions. You can focus on racing, repairs, trading, or simply exploring the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.poster.avif?t=1753713523\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.webm?t=1753713523\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/d8d005314f8b3f8b8fcf7ab4c3ec11b5.mp4?t=1753713523\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Key features:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect and modify cars:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Retro, experimental, quirky \u2014 each one has its own character. Buy, assemble from spare parts, and upgrade to suit your needs: for racing, trading, or traveling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take part in races:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Test the power of your car on different tracks \u2014 from country roads to abandoned concrete roads. Win rewards, resources, and prestige.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft and upgrade:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect resources, repair, tune cars, and even rebuild your own base. Start with a shack \u2014 develop it into a real auto repair shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Live trading with NPCs:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trade metal, nuts, auto parts, or even cars themselves. The market responds to demand \u2014 find your niche.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level up your character:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From driving skills to master craftsman skills \u2014 everything affects your chances in the game world. Every action leaves a mark on your history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An open world with a Ukrainian vibe:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel through picturesque locations \u2014 quiet villages, abandoned gas stations, craft markets, and techno zones. Every place is a new adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">______________________________________________________________</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><i><strong>Rust Rides is about you:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to be a trader who turned a garage into an empire?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Love speed and can't live without racing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Or maybe you like collecting old cars and restoring them to perfection?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your path here is <u>unlimited.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">______________________________________________________________</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>No unnecessary hype. No forced storyline.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Just the world, cars, and you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Survive. Compete. Live on the road.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/extras/PNG_TavriyaDemoSPG1.png?t=1753713523\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3766240?t=1753713523","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/3a706be2b4a8324d37c58b8ca57c469d77509538/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753713523","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/da4d73e6586ff1a3217791e3cf2e65f7355fe6ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753713523","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3766240/da4d73e6586ff1a3217791e3cf2e65f7355fe6ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753713523","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"descr